<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina places $250 mln in 91-day T bills.</title>
<headline>Argentina places $250 mln in 91-day T bills.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina Tuesday placed $250 million in 91-day Letes Treasury bills at a cut-off yield of 6.38 percent, the Economy Ministry said.</p>
<p>The price was 983.8728 and a total of 87 offers were made, the ministry said. Market makers have an option for an additional 10 percent in Letes until 1700 local/2000 GMT.  </p>
<p>Of the $250 million sold in Letes, $224.5 million were allocated on competitive bids.</p>
<p>-- Buenos Aires Newsroom + 541 318-0552</p>
